.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Bennett","r":[0.2204,0.8519,0.0389,0.0311]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/xianyun/261111-225405/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Crane's Echoing Call","text":"Very high Base ATK strengthens her plunge buff. A Skill plunge buffs allies’ plunges and their plunges restore her Energy. Strongest in teams that plunge repeatedly."},{"name":"Skyward Atlas","text":"High Base ATK and ATK% help maximize her healing and plunge buff when Energy Recharge is already covered. Best with adequate ER, especially Xiao plus Faruzan."},{"name":"Favonius Codex","text":"Energy Recharge and CRIT-triggered particles help Xianyun Burst every rotation and lower team Energy needs. Build some CRIT Rate and hit enemies to trigger its passive. Higher refinements improve consistency."},{"name":"Oathsworn Eye","text":"ATK% raises healing and plunge buffs."},{"name":"Flowing Purity","text":"Craftable high Base ATK and ATK% help her buff and healing; its personal damage passive is not the main reason to use it. Use when Burst uptime is already comfortable."},{"name":"Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","text":"Gives the next character a large ATK buff, useful for Xiao or Gaming, but its low Base ATK weakens Xianyun’s own plunge bonus. Swap directly to an ATK-scaling carry. R5 recommended for the full ATK buff."},{"name":"Prototype Amber","text":"Restores Xianyun’s Energy and heals the party after Burst. A comfort option, though HP% does not strengthen her ATK-based buff. Prefer when extra sustain and Energy matter. R5 improves Energy and healing."},{"name":"Hakushin Ring","text":"Energy Recharge and elemental buffs can help Electro teams after she triggers an Electro-related Swirl reaction. Situational Electro teams only; not for Xiao hypercarry."}],"a":[{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Swirling Pyro, Hydro or Electro reduces that element’s enemy RES by 40%. Best for reaction carries when Xianyun can Swirl the right aura.","stats":"ER% or ATK% · ATK% · ATK%"},{"names":["Song of Days Past"],"text":"Turns her large Burst healing into an added damage bonus for the active carry, useful when VV cannot shred the carry’s Anemo RES.","stats":"ER% or ATK% · ATK% · ATK%"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Burst grants the party 20% ATK for 12 seconds.","stats":"ER% or ATK% · ATK% · ATK%"}],"t":[{"name":"Cloud Nine","members":["Xianyun","Xiao","Faruzan","Furina"],"text":"Xianyun's healing fuels Furina's Fanfare while her plunge buff amplifies Xiao. Faruzan shreds Anemo RES and boosts his damage.","roles":["Healer / Plunge Buff","Main DPS","Anemo Buffer","Hydro Buffer"]},{"name":"Curtain Call","members":["Xianyun","Gaming","Furina","Bennett"],"text":"Furina supplies Hydro for Gaming's Vaporized plunges. Bennett boosts ATK while Xianyun heals, enables jumps and buffs his plunge hits.","roles":["Healer / VV","Main DPS","Hydro / DMG Buff","ATK Buff"]},{"name":"Dragon Drop","members":["Xianyun","Diluc","Furina","Bennett"],"text":"Xianyun lets Diluc spam his strong plunges. Furina applies Hydro for Vaporize; Bennett adds ATK and Xianyun provides healing and buffs.","roles":["Healer / VV","Main DPS","Hydro / DMG Buff","ATK Buff"]},{"name":"Budget Takeoff","members":["Xianyun","Gaming","Xingqiu","Bennett"],"text":"Gaming plunges with Xianyun's buff; weave Normal Attacks to trigger Xingqiu's Hydro swords for Vaporize. Bennett buffs ATK and heals.","roles":["Healer / VV","Main DPS","Hydro Sub DPS","ATK Buff"]}],"v":"Xiao Hypercarry: With Xiao and Faruzan, prioritize ATK after meeting ER needs. Song of Days Past or Noblesse often beats VV for Anemo damage.\nPyro Vaporize: Swirl Pyro before swapping to Gaming or Diluc to activate Viridescent Venerer. Furina supplies Hydro for Vaporize plunges.\nEnergy First: As solo Anemo, Favonius Codex and an ER Sands may be needed. Reliable Burst uptime matters more than reaching 4,500 ATK.\nC2 Plunge Buff: C2 raises Xianyun’s plunge support ceiling substantially. Still meet her Energy needs before stacking ATK.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Support","Healer"],"about":"Xianyun heals the whole party and lets allies plunge during her Burst. Her ATK-based passive adds DMG to plunges, making her exceptional with Xiao, Gaming, and other plunge carries. Build enough ER to Burst every rotation, then stack ATK.","pros":["Enables plunge attacks","Strong teamwide healing","Powerful plunge buff","Great with Furina"],"cons":["High Energy needs","Buff favors single target","Plunge playstyle required","Needs ATK investment"],"weapons":["Crane's Echoing Call","Skyward Atlas","Favonius Codex","Oathsworn Eye","Flowing Purity","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Prototype Amber","Hakushin Ring"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Elemental Teams"},{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Anemo Plunge Teams"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"ATK Buff"}],"main":["Energy Recharge / ATK%","ATK%","ATK% / CRIT Rate (Favonius)"],"stats":["ATK: 3,000 - 4,500 (with buffs)","Energy Recharge: 180% - 220% (double Anemo)","Energy Recharge: 220% - 300% (solo Anemo)","CRIT Rate: 30% - 50% (Favonius only)"],"vars":[{"title":"Xiao Plunge Support","role":"Anemo Plunge Buffer","weapons":["Crane's Echoing Call","Skyward Atlas","Oathsworn Eye","Favonius Codex"],"arts":[{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"After meeting ER needs, push ATK toward the 4,500 buff cap. Double Anemo and Faruzan reduce required ER.","teams":"Xiao and Faruzan; Furina is an excellent fourth teammate.","when":"Use with Xiao when Viridescent Venerer cannot shred the Anemo damage he deals. Her healing also builds Furina Fanfare.","cond":"Do not duplicate Noblesse on the same team.","notes":"C2 is an especially strong support upgrade.","pre":false},{"title":"Vaporize Plunge Enabler","role":"Reaction Support","weapons":["Crane's Echoing Call","Favonius Codex","Oathsworn Eye"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER first, then ATK. Aim for a Pyro Swirl to shred Pyro RES before the carry begins plunging.","teams":"Gaming or Diluc; Hydro application from Furina or Xingqiu.","when":"Choose this setup to enable and buff Pyro plunges while decreasing enemy Pyro resistance.","cond":"VV must Swirl Pyro to shred Pyro RES.","notes":"Xingqiu needs Normal Attacks between plunges to launch his Burst swords.","pre":false},{"title":"High Energy / Budget","role":"Accessible Support","weapons":["Favonius Codex","Oathsworn Eye","Prototype Amber","Flowing Purity"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Song of Days Past"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use an ER Sands if needed; add CRIT Rate for Favonius procs, then focus on ATK.","teams":"Any plunge carry; team battery or Favonius holders ease the Energy demand.","when":"For teams where her Burst is not ready every rotation. Comfortable healing and jump access outweigh a little extra ATK.","cond":"Favonius requires a CRIT hit; Prototype Amber gives less ATK.","notes":"Check ER per team. Solo Anemo needs substantially more Energy Recharge.","pre":false},{"title":"C6 On-field Plunge","role":"On-field Anemo DPS","weapons":["Skyward Atlas","Crane's Echoing Call"],"arts":[{"sets":["Marechaussee Hunter"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build CRIT and ATK with enough ER; unlike the support build, personal Anemo damage matters.","teams":"C6 Xianyun, C6 Faruzan, Furina, and Bennett offer a strong damage shell.","when":"Only for players who want Xianyun herself to be the plunge carry instead of supporting another character.","cond":"Requires C6 for the intended offensive playstyle.","notes":"Situational constellation build, not the recommended C0 support setup.","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Cloudseam Scale","Teachings of Gold","Guide to Gold","Philosophies of Gold","Divining Scroll","Sealed Scroll","Forbidden Curse Scroll","Clearwater Jade","Lightless Eye of the Maelstrom","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 6-8"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Cloud Nine","members":["Xianyun","Xiao","Faruzan","Furina"]},{"name":"Curtain Call","members":["Xianyun","Gaming","Furina","Bennett"]},{"name":"Dragon Drop","members":["Xianyun","Diluc","Furina","Bennett"]},{"name":"Budget Takeoff","members":["Xianyun","Gaming","Xingqiu","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Xianyun","el":"Anemo"}